{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 10, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "## Lost (and Found) in Japan!\n\nJust back from the most incredible trip to Japan! It was a whirlwind of ancient traditions and futuristic vibes – a truly unforgettable experience.\n\nMy journey started in Tokyo, a city that never sleeps. The neon lights of Shibuya Crossing were mesmerizing, and exploring the quirky shops of Harajuku was a blast. I spent hours wandering through peaceful gardens, a welcome escape from the urban buzz. The food, oh the food! From steaming bowls of ramen to delicate sushi, every meal was a delight.\n\nNext, I took the Shinkansen (bullet train!) to Kyoto. The contrast was striking. Here, I explored serene temples like Kinkaku-ji (the Golden Pavilion) and Fushimi Inari Shrine with its thousands of vibrant red torii gates. I even participated in a traditional tea ceremony – a beautiful and calming experience.\n\nBeyond the big cities, I ventured into the Japanese Alps. The scenery was breathtaking – rolling hills, lush forests, and charming mountain villages. It was a perfect opportunity to slow down and appreciate the natural beauty of the country.\n\nJapan is a place that stimulates all your senses. It’s a culture of respect, politeness, and incredible artistry. I left feeling inspired, refreshed, and already dreaming of my return. Definitely add it to your bucket list!\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "##", "logprob": -1.4305104514278355e-06}, {"token": "▁Lost", "logprob": -0.0011843579122796655}, {"token": "▁(", "logprob": -0.16028544306755066}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"token": "▁Found", "logprob": -0.0018123644404113293}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.14268335700035095}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.0902157872915268}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -1.5145410299301147}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -3.933898824470816e-06}, {"token": "Just", "logprob": -0.011876351200